<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0359_R18R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cycling Road ALL uphill from this end.\nIt’s REAL hard. My calves cryin’.\rStill, it might be fun to go up once.\nPedal HARD. Regret everythin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0359_R18R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, you!\rCycling Road for BIKERS only.\nYou gotta be on a Bike to go through!\fWalkin’ is for quitters.\r</language>
	</row>
</body>
